@startuml Class_ComponentSystem
' Character 컴포넌트 구성
' Character가 보유한 컴포넌트들의 역할

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    BorderColor #1976D2
}

title Character 컴포넌트 구성

class Character {
    # stateSystem
    # abilitySystem
    # statComponent
    # movement
    # rigidbody
    # collider
    # animator
}

class StateSystem <<상태 관리>> {
    - currentTags: EStateTag
    --
    + AddTag() / RemoveTag()
    + HasTag(): bool
    ..
    + OnStateChanged
}

class AbilitySystem <<능력 관리>> {
    - abilities: map
    - activeAbilities: vector
    --
    + TryActivateAbility()
    + CancelAbility()
    ..
    + OnEvent
}

class StatComponent <<스탯 관리>> {
    - stats: map<Type, FStat>
    --
    + TakeDamage()
    + Heal()
    + IsAlive(): bool
    ..
    + OnStatChanged
}

class CharacterMovement <<이동/충돌>> {
    - groundState
    - frameFlags
    --
    + IsGrounded(): bool
    + DidHitWall(): bool
    + HandleCollision()
}

Character *-down- StateSystem
Character *-down- AbilitySystem
Character *-down- StatComponent
Character *-down- CharacterMovement

note right of StateSystem
  비트필드 태그로
  O(1) 상태 체크
end note

note right of AbilitySystem
  선언적 조건으로
  능력 발동 관리
end note

note right of StatComponent
  HP/MP/Flask 등
  리소스 관리
end note

note right of CharacterMovement
  지면/벽/경사면
  충돌 처리
end note

@enduml
